\fs28 b2\
April 2022\

\fs26 \

\fs36 Brief
\fs26 \

\fs28 An OXP containing the ships originally released by Aegidian in several OXPs, retextured Iron Ass style .\

\fs26 \

\fs36 Overview
\fs26 \

\fs28 This OXP contains 12 ships: the Asp X, Cobra mk.II-X, Hamadryad, Josher, Griffin mk.II, Mussurana, Naga, Pelamis, Python Class Cruiser, Python Eunectes Turbo, Ringhals and the Sidewinder X. \
\
All but the Sidewinder X are player-available ships.\

\fs26 \

\fs36 Background
\fs26 \

\fs28 This OXP is a gathering of all \'96to my knowledge\'96 the OXP ships Aegidian released (well, except for the feature demonstrator Weeviloid and mammoths Behemoth and Jormundgand) in the period 2004-2006, and here released with only minor model modifications but new darkly metallic skin expressions. \

\fs26 \

\fs36 Version history
\fs26 \

\fs28 b1 		04/22	Complete shipset. WIP publish.\
b2 		04/22	shipdata, shipyard tweak, replace missing tex\
b3		06/22	shiplib typos, resize AspX, replace AspX engines\

\fs26 \

\fs36 Acknowledgements
\fs26 \

\fs28 The original ship model designs are all by Aegidian, except the Griffin mk.II which seems likely an Ian Bell design included in the \'93Elite 2\'94 tier of ships that only appeared in late special edition Elites. \
\
The Python Class Cruiser closely follows the concept illustration by the nameless artist of the 
\f1\i Elite Space Trader\'92s Flight Manual
